    TrackFit) ends with "14 kernels ran while the memory pool was not mapped for
    the GPU" and a GPU Backend Failure instead of 22,250 tracks. It is opt-in
    because the extra dispatch costs 1021-1038 ms/event against 979-989 at pbpb30
    (3 rounds of 10 events).

