    the CPU at 27 sectors. It is not the length of the dispatch: at pbpb30 a 1.5 s
    host sleep before a normal TrackFit gives the same picture (0 retry refits, 0
    looper candidates, 22,250 tracks for 21,360), and a 1.7 s single TrackFit
    dispatch completes once the pools are made resident with useResource (207
    looper fits, 4,521 retry refits, 10,775 candidates, 21,361 tracks, as without
    the sleep).
    
