    are always all uppercase, regardless of the value of CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE. We use the
    camel cased version, because that's what strongly suggested by CMake (probably because the
    generators for some IDE / tool use that convention).
    
    Moreover MinSizeRel is the typical spelling, not MinRelSize.

