    Profile analysis has shown that material budget calculations
    used in tracking, spent most time in
     (a) determination of a cylindrical layer
     (b) determination of a phi sector in a layer
    
    This commit proposes an improvement for (a). Instead
    of determining the layer id via binary search, we can
    use a simple lookup structure working on regular R-intervals.
    
