    timingInfo.TFCounter has ID < N*M (note the change: before the check
    would be done only for (timingInfo.timeSlice % M) == 0.
    
    Also, the --condition-tf-per-query M will trigger a check not for
    (timingInfo.timeSlice % M) == 0 but once previously checked TFCounter
    is more than M TFs old.

