    RangeTokenizer<int>, e.g. 1,4-6,...
    Note that the index corresponds not to DataHeader.TFcounter of the TF but to the reader own
    counter incremented throught all input files (e.g. if 10 raw-TF files with 20 TFs each
    are provided for the input and the selection of TFs 0,2,22,66 is provided, the reader will
    inject to the DPL the TFs at entries 0 and 2 from the 1st raw-TF file, entry 5 of the second file,
    entry 6 of the 3d and will finish the job.

